'''telemetric''' (tel-ẹ̄-met′rik), ''a.'' [< ''telemetr-y'' + ''-ic.''] Pertaining to automatic registration at a distance of the indications of physical and meteorological instruments.

{{smaller block|''Telemetric'' aid to meteorological records.
{{right|''Science'', VI. 194.}}}}

